# Copy to yandex.local.env (ignored by git) and fill in. Read by scripts/diary-serverless-deploy.sh
# and scripts/diary-admin.sh after yandex.env; values here win.
#
# The service owner(s) who may open «Обзор сервиса» (docs/DIARY_ADMIN.md): sign-in e-mails of
# doctors, separated by semicolons (yc takes commas between variables). Empty or absent: nobody can,
# and the deploy leaves the variable out.
DIARY_ADMIN_EMAILS=""
